# Unknowns register: {{PROJET_NAME}}

> Frame 18. Every scoping question lives here with a stable ID. Never delete a line: change its status.
> **Closing rule**: `/cloture-cadrage` refuses to close while a `blocking: yes` line has status `open`.
> Statuses: `open` · `answered` · `assumption` (taken without an answer, to be confirmed by the named person) · `dropped`.
> A question that can be answered by reading a file, the code or the docs does not belong here: look it up first.

```yaml
questions:
  - id: Q-01
    area: need              # user | need | scope | data | constraints | validation | technical
    question: ""
    blocking: yes           # yes = blocks scoping closure while open
    recommendation: ""      # proposed option + one-line reason
    ask: ""                 # who can answer (role)
    status: open
    answer: ""
    by: ""
    on: ""                  # YYYY-MM-DD
    impact: ""              # what the answer changes: REQ-xx, phase, decision
```
